{"items":[{"id":"1520447183974850561","title":"往好处想，这次没有临时工了","content":"<p>往好处想，这次没有临时工了。&lt;br&gt;也是一种进步。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a137c69e2f5e3c175456c32a9209ca13_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"213\">","excerpt":"往好处想，这次没有临时工了","voteupCount":133,"commentCount":41,"created":1655282857,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1520447183974850561"},{"id":"1520405459470774272","title":"谁能来验证一下?","content":"<p>谁能来验证一下?</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-1c2db3103943662378e730447aa1db05_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"977\">","excerpt":"谁能来验证一下?","voteupCount":74,"commentCount":70,"created":1655272909,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1520405459470774272"},{"id":"1520137552937443328","title":"这个实际是有的，每个县都有那么几个上访…","content":"<p>这个实际是有的，每个县都有那么几个上访钉子户，但是大家知道最操蛋的点是什么吗？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;如果你只上访一次，被逮着了，你就会被安上不稳定因素，上内部档案，不被良民对待。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;但是，如果你把上访当做职业，你会变得无人敢惹，逢年过节有人给你送礼。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;简单来说，上访一次，你被制裁，上访n次，你就获得了真正意义上的统战价值。</p>","excerpt":"这个实际是有的，每个县都有那么几个上访…","voteupCount":204,"commentCount":19,"created":1655209035,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1520137552937443328"},{"id":"1520034182122545152","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-898474190d0710c1d0ef25c49097a053_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1193\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":128,"commentCount":32,"created":1655184389,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1520034182122545152"},{"id":"1519729011626782720","title":"麦的收成还是不错的","content":"<p>麦的收成还是不错的。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-a7c6755a33b3f3d8f3d4f2bdb23660b5_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"2250\" height=\"4000\">","excerpt":"麦的收成还是不错的","voteupCount":82,"commentCount":26,"created":1655111631,"url":"